1. Substances to Incorporate
Primary Substances for Altered States
1. Psilocybin (Magic Mushrooms):
	•	  Why: Enhances creativity, introspection, emotional breakthroughs, and pattern recognition.
	•	  Dosage:
	•	  Microdose: 0.1-0.3g for subtle, functional effects.
	•	  Moderate: 1-2g for immersive insights and altered perception.
	•	  Tips: Pair with Lion's Mane for neurogenesis.

2. Cannabis (THC and CBD):
	•	  Why: Amplifies sensory perception, relaxation, and divergent thinking.
	•	  Dosage: Choose strains to match your goals:
	•	  Sativa: Energy and creativity.
	•	  Indica: Deep relaxation and introspection.
	•	  Hybrid: A balance of effects.

3. LSD (Lysergic Acid Diethylamide):
	•	  Why: Sharpens focus, lateral thinking, and emotional depth.
	•	  Dosage:
	•	  Microdose: 10-20 ug for subtle cognitive enhancement.
	•	  Low dose: 50-75 ug for immersive

4. MDMA (Optional for Emotional Work):
	•	  Why: Promotes euphoria, emotional connection, and self-acceptance.
	•	  Dosage: 40-70 mg for a lighter experience, focusing on emotional clarity.

